WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.044
An equation has a mystery number. We call it x.

2
00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:16.466
The equals sign means both sides are BALANCED.

3
00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:20.266
Left: x and 3 more. Right: 7.

4
00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:23.973
Golden rule: do the SAME to both sides.

5
00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:27.243
To get x alone, take away 3...

6
00:00:32.433 --> 00:00:34.801
...from BOTH sides. Still balanced!

7
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.333
So x equals 4.

8
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.455
Always check: put 4 back in. 4 + 3 equals 7. Correct!

9
00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:50.637
What does 3x mean? It means 3 lots of x.

10
00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:58.091
3 x's balance 12. Split both sides into 3 equal groups.

11
00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:04.296
One x balances one group of 4.

12
00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:10.611
Divide both sides by 3. x equals 4.

13
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.547
To undo adding, subtract. To undo subtracting, add.

14
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:23.480
To undo multiplying, divide. These are INVERSE operations.

15
00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.046
Now a two-step equation.

16
00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:34.723
Step 1: get rid of the + 1. Take 1 from both sides.

17
00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:42.525
Now 2x equals 10.

18
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.101
Step 2: divide both sides by 2.

19
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:56.137
x equals 5. Check: 2 times 5 + 1 equals 11 ✓

20
00:01:58.133 --> 00:01:59.851
Here is how to write it down.

21
00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:07.698
Undo the + first, then the times . Write the step on the side.

22
00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:14.775
Your turn! Solve 3x + 2 equals 14. Pause the video.

23
00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:26.450
x equals 4. Did you get it?

24
00:02:31.933 --> 00:02:34.069
Keep it balanced, and always check!
